# Tenant Portal — TokenRealty Frontend

Human docs: [docs/rules/tenant-portal.md](../../docs/rules/tenant-portal.md).

## Stack

React 19 + TypeScript, Vite (`:5175`), TanStack Query, React Router, Tailwind.

## Rules

- All API via gateway — session key `tokenrealty.tenant.auth`
- TENANT role only — `TenantRoute` guard
- Leases: `GET /v1/leases?tenantId={userId}`
- Pay rent: `POST /v1/rent-payments` with `{ leaseId, period, amount }`
- History: `GET /v1/rent-payments?leaseId=…`
- Period format: `YYYY-MM`

## Run

```bash
cd frontend/tenant-portal && npm install && npm run dev
```

Demo: `tenant@tokenrealty.com` / `tenant123`.
